text:
Rain didn’t stop Iranian Australian’s from rallying in Brisbane this evening, in solidarity with anti-government protesters in Iran. Attendees said it was their responsibility to use their voices to support those back home who couldn't. 
@abcnews
 #IranProtests2026 #Iran

